## 📄 workflow.json (Pipedream Export)

To export your workflow:
1. In Pipedream, open your workflow
2. Click the **⋮ (three dots)** menu → **Export** → **Download JSON**
3. Save as `workflow.json` in your repo

> 💡 **Pro Tip**: Before exporting, replace any hardcoded tokens/keys with Pipedream environment variables (`{{env.VARIABLE_NAME}}`) so others can safely import it.

